vival of end-stage dementia patients</article-title><source>Age Ageing</source><year>2006</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>597</fpage><lpage>601</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16926196</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ageing/afl067</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>PSSRU</collab></person-group><source>Dementia UK: A report to the Alzheimer's Society on the prevalence and economic cost of dementia in the UK produced by King's College London and London School of Economics</source><year>2007</year><publisher-name>London: Alzheimer's Society</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>